<p>All spell criticals reduce the remaining cooldown of a random spell/corruption/celestial/chronomancy talent by 2.</p><p>All physical criticals reduce the remaining cooldown of a random technique or cunning talent by 2.</p><p>All mind criticals reduce the remaining cooldown of a random wild gift/psionic/afflicted talent by 2.</p><p>All steamtech criticals reduce the remaining cooldown of a random steamtech talent by 1.		</p><p>This can only happen once per turn per type, and cannot affect the talent that triggers it.</p>